 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.34,
   "text": " Good morning everyone, thanks for joining the monthly review."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 3.88,
   "end": 8.3,
   "text": " Thanks, I have to say I am really frustrated with the overtime this month."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 8.92,
   "end": 12.0,
   "text": " I understand, let's go through the numbers first."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 13.04,
   "end": 15.94,
   "text": " Sales went up by 12%, which is great news."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 16.58,
   "end": 19.78,
   "text": " That is good, but my team is exhausted and nobody noticed."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 20.54,
   "end": 23.32,
   "text": " I'm sorry to hear that, what happened exactly?"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 23.96,
   "end": 26.66,
   "text": " We stayed until 10 every night for two weeks."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 27.38,
   "end": 29.78,
   "text": " Wow, I had no idea it was that bad."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 30.04,
   "end": 33.02,
   "text": " We need to fix the schedule before the next release."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 33.72,
   "end": 36.02,
   "text": " Honestly, I am worried people will quit."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 36.78,
   "end": 39.12,
   "text": " Then let's hire two more people next quarter."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 39.78,
   "end": 42.7,
   "text": " I love that idea, I will talk to finance today."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 43.52,
   "end": 45.46,
   "text": " Thank you, that really helps."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 46.26,
   "end": 48.86,
   "text": " Next item, the office move is delayed again."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 49.44,
   "end": 52.16,
   "text": " Seriously, that is the third delay this year."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 52.76,
   "end": 54.74,
   "text": " The new building still has no internet."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 55.46,
   "end": 58.24,
   "text": " It's disgusting that the landlord keeps lying to us."
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 58.78,
   "end": 61.24,
   "text": " Let's stay calm and send a formal complaint."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 61.84,
   "end": 64.5,
   "text": " Fine, I will draft it this afternoon."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 65.2,
   "end": 67.36,
   "text": " Last thing, we won the client award."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 68.0,
   "end": 70.88,
   "text": " That is amazing, congratulations to everyone."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 71.56,
   "end": 74.34,
   "text": " I didn't expect that at all, what a surprise."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 75.24,
   "end": 78.52,
   "text": " Okay, that's all for today, see you next month."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 79.16,
   "end": 81.3,
   "text": " Thanks everyone, have a good week."
  }
 ],
